<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-the-consequent#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-the-consequent/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-the-consequent/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Besides the stated antecedent, what else could make the consequent true?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-the-consequent/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-the-consequent> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-the-consequent/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-the-consequent/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Does the conditional really run both ways, or has a one-way \"if\" been heard as \"if and only if\"?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-the-consequent/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-the-consequent> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-the-consequent/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-the-consequent/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "How often does the consequent occur when the antecedent is false, and has that rate been checked?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-the-consequent/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-the-consequent> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-the-consequent/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-the-consequent/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Have rival explanations of the observed consequent been compared before accepting the antecedent?" .
