  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/validity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The property of a deductive argument whose form makes it impossible for all the premises to be true and the conclusion false; validity concerns the link between premises and conclusion, not whether the premises are actually true." .
