  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/straw-man-fallacy/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/straw-man-fallacy/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is the view being refuted what was actually said, or an exaggerated, absolute or invented version of it?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/straw-man-fallacy/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/straw-man-fallacy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/straw-man-fallacy/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/straw-man-fallacy/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "If the weakest argument has been answered, have the stronger arguments for the same conclusion been addressed too?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/straw-man-fallacy/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/straw-man-fallacy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/straw-man-fallacy/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/straw-man-fallacy/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Who exactly holds the position being attacked, or is it attributed only to a vague \"some people\"?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/straw-man-fallacy/cq/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/straw-man-fallacy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/straw-man-fallacy/cq/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/straw-man-fallacy/cq/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Does refuting this version leave the original claim standing?" .
