  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gettier-problem> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The problem, raised by Edmund Gettier in 1963, that a person can hold a justified, true belief that still falls short of knowledge because it is true only by luck; it shows that justified true belief is not sufficient for knowing." .
